{"id":"wb-8-314","name":"亳州薛阁塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"薛阁塔","text":"薛阁塔，原名文峰塔，位于中国安徽省亳州市谯城区薛阁路中段，建于清乾隆三十七年（1772年）至嘉庆十七年（1812年），为八角七层仿木作楼阁式砖塔，塔高34.15米，青石塔座底边长2.94米，2019年被列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%96%9B%E9%98%81%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91829060,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91829060","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ef2f9334b94ddf9659af48e4.jpg","title":"20260210_Xuege_Pagoda_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260210_Xuege_Pagoda_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/20260210_Xuege_Pagoda_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​亳州薛阁塔","width":320,"height":480}}